00:51:12.280 --> 00:51:14.080
So you know what the television was?

00:51:14.400 --> 00:51:15.680
My grandfather used to say,

00:51:15.740 --> 00:51:19.500
That was the television.

00:51:19.940 --> 00:51:22.100
So we used to hear those kind of stories.

00:51:23.320 --> 00:51:24.240
They may be true.

00:51:24.860 --> 00:51:28.240
That the Bet HaMikdash is not the real Bet HaMikdash.

00:51:28.360 --> 00:51:31.100
That's not the real place where the Aksa...

00:51:31.100 --> 00:51:32.140
The Kotel.

00:51:32.520 --> 00:51:33.320
The Kotel, yes.

00:51:33.320 --> 00:51:35.440
but not the Jamel, it's not on the spot of the

00:51:35.440 --> 00:51:36.120
Qorusha Qoroshim.

00:51:38.680 --> 00:51:40.420
It's not on it.

00:51:40.920 --> 00:51:42.140
He showed it to me.

00:51:42.380 --> 00:51:43.280
Yes, it's not on it.

00:51:43.900 --> 00:51:44.680
It's further.

00:51:45.740 --> 00:51:47.340
It doesn't say that the

00:51:47.340 --> 00:51:50.200
exile is not on Qorusha Qoroshim.

00:51:50.320 --> 00:51:51.500
It's not on the

00:51:51.500 --> 00:51:52.040
holy ground.

00:51:52.040 --> 00:51:52.460
What happened?

00:51:53.460 --> 00:51:53.940
Now,

00:51:54.140 --> 00:51:58.160
we don't

00:51:58.160 --> 00:52:00.100
have much time, and we have a fantastic

00:52:00.100 --> 00:52:00.860
video.

00:52:00.860 --> 00:52:03.580
Vayam Moshe minahal ha'am

00:52:03.580 --> 00:52:05.760
and Moses comes

00:52:05.760 --> 00:52:07.520
back down from the mountain

00:52:07.520 --> 00:52:09.260
v'kadesh et ha'am

00:52:09.260 --> 00:52:11.080
and he tells the people

00:52:11.080 --> 00:52:12.740
to make themselves holy

00:52:12.740 --> 00:52:15.220
v'kadesh et z'lodam

00:52:15.220 --> 00:52:16.920
and to wash the glory

00:52:16.920 --> 00:52:19.520
v'yomer ha'am

00:52:19.520 --> 00:52:21.240
hayum mechalim l'shoshet yamim

00:52:21.240 --> 00:52:22.780
alti g'shu

00:52:22.780 --> 00:52:23.920
el isha

00:52:23.920 --> 00:52:27.220
in other words, marital relations were forbidden

00:52:27.220 --> 00:52:29.100
now

00:52:29.100 --> 00:52:33.660
comes the dawn of the third day.

00:52:35.340 --> 00:52:39.080
And it came to pass

00:52:39.080 --> 00:52:40.540
three days hence,

00:52:41.980 --> 00:52:47.040
as the morning was breaking,

00:52:48.620 --> 00:52:51.360
they heard

00:52:51.360 --> 00:52:52.560
thunders,

00:52:54.020 --> 00:52:57.100
and lightnings.

00:52:57.100 --> 00:53:05.100
and they see very heavy cloud covering the mountain.

00:53:05.100 --> 00:53:17.100
They call shofar, and there was the sound of a shofar becoming stronger and stronger.

00:53:17.100 --> 00:53:22.100
Usually when you call the shofar, it is strong and it becomes weaker and weaker and weaker,

00:53:22.100 --> 00:53:23.040
because you lose the breath.

00:53:23.640 --> 00:53:23.840
Yes?

00:53:24.240 --> 00:53:28.280
In this case, it was becoming stronger and stronger.

00:53:30.000 --> 00:53:33.120
Vayehirat kol ha'am asher v'machane.

00:53:33.660 --> 00:53:36.380
And now, when they saw this,

00:53:37.040 --> 00:53:39.200
they realized that that's not a regular thunder,

00:53:39.720 --> 00:53:41.500
it is not a regular lightning,

00:53:41.960 --> 00:53:43.400
it's not a regular shofar.

00:53:44.780 --> 00:53:46.780
They're trembling, shaking.

00:53:47.560 --> 00:53:51.040
Vayehirat kol ha'am asher v'machane.

00:53:51.040 --> 00:53:53.340
all the people in the camp

00:53:53.340 --> 00:53:54.640
started crying

00:53:54.640 --> 00:53:59.620
and they were so much afraid

00:53:59.620 --> 00:54:02.080
that the people would not even come near the mountain

00:54:02.080 --> 00:54:07.420
and God and Moses

00:54:07.420 --> 00:54:08.200
pushes

00:54:08.200 --> 00:54:11.000
literally pushes the people

00:54:11.000 --> 00:54:13.060
from the camp

00:54:13.060 --> 00:54:15.100
to go and meet God

00:54:15.100 --> 00:54:16.560
by the mountain

00:54:16.560 --> 00:54:23.340
and all of them stood erect

00:54:23.340 --> 00:54:26.100
looking from the bottom

00:54:26.100 --> 00:54:28.000
from the foot of the mountain

00:54:28.000 --> 00:54:34.200
and all of Mount Sinai

00:54:34.200 --> 00:54:36.080
was full of

00:54:36.080 --> 00:54:37.160
a cloud

00:54:37.160 --> 00:54:40.140
modern in parenthesis

00:54:40.140 --> 00:54:42.500
not parenthesis in quotation mark

00:54:42.500 --> 00:54:43.780
modern historians say

00:54:43.780 --> 00:54:46.160
this was a volcano

00:54:46.160 --> 00:54:49.160
Jews, stupid, never saw a volcano.

00:54:49.160 --> 00:54:57.160
Modern geologists and archaeologists say there are no volcanoes.

00:54:57.160 --> 00:55:01.160
There never were volcanoes, and there still are no volcanoes.

00:55:01.160 --> 00:55:05.160
So therefore, one thing for sure, this was not a volcano.

00:55:05.160 --> 00:55:09.160
Because if there are volcanoes, they have special formations, geological formations,

00:55:09.160 --> 00:55:11.160
they know exactly where a volcano is.

00:55:11.160 --> 00:55:13.160
You cannot hide a volcano.

00:55:13.160 --> 00:55:32.440
volcano. Lo haya volcano, lo no yie volcano. It is a miracle. You know why? Because when

00:55:32.440 --> 00:55:34.780
that came, came down in fire.

00:55:35.940 --> 00:55:39.680
And the smoke would go up straight.

00:55:42.620 --> 00:55:47.820
As if it would be the smoke rising out from a furnace.

00:55:49.860 --> 00:55:53.120
And the whole mountain started shaking.

00:55:53.120 --> 00:55:58.440
V'hi kol ha-shofar, holek v'chazek me'od.

00:55:59.240 --> 00:56:03.980
And while all this thunder and these noises and the shaking of the mountain

00:56:03.980 --> 00:56:06.880
and the smoke and the clouds,

00:56:08.400 --> 00:56:12.460
the voice of the shofar was going stronger and stronger.

00:56:12.920 --> 00:56:14.580
Holek v'chazek me'od.

00:56:15.660 --> 00:56:17.940
And yet, a miracle happened.

00:56:17.940 --> 00:56:21.880
Moses would speak

00:56:21.880 --> 00:56:23.140
in a normal voice

00:56:23.140 --> 00:56:26.880
there was thunderous

00:56:26.880 --> 00:56:28.520
an enormous amount of noise

00:56:28.520 --> 00:56:30.720
noise would quench

00:56:30.720 --> 00:56:32.900
normal speech

00:56:32.900 --> 00:56:35.020
if it's too much noise

00:56:35.020 --> 00:56:36.240
and people speak you cannot hear

00:56:36.240 --> 00:56:38.140
and yet

00:56:38.140 --> 00:56:41.160
God and Moses would be speaking

00:56:41.160 --> 00:56:43.020
and the people

00:56:43.020 --> 00:56:44.200
could hear them clearly

00:56:44.200 --> 00:56:46.860
obviously these words

00:56:46.860 --> 00:56:48.860
not a kind of speech

00:56:48.860 --> 00:56:51.120
that could be quenched by noise.

00:56:52.340 --> 00:56:52.720
Simple.

00:56:53.380 --> 00:56:53.920
You understand?

00:56:54.540 --> 00:56:56.760
Now comes the

00:56:56.760 --> 00:57:00.920
let me go to the

00:57:00.920 --> 00:57:01.700
Assetto di Berotto.

00:57:01.700 --> 00:57:02.680
All right.

00:57:04.540 --> 00:57:05.300
The battle

00:57:05.300 --> 00:57:05.600
passes.

00:57:07.580 --> 00:57:08.720
By the very Elohim,

00:57:08.820 --> 00:57:09.320
and God

00:57:09.320 --> 00:57:12.780
speaks

00:57:12.780 --> 00:57:14.940
when it goes down to Mount Sinai,

00:57:15.080 --> 00:57:16.780
it's going to give us the thankful man.

00:57:16.860 --> 00:57:24.860
Just let me give you a few remarks about the Ten Commandments.

00:57:24.860 --> 00:57:34.860
It is made, there's exactly the one who counted the letter, was the greatest Hakam ever, prior to Rambam.

00:57:34.860 --> 00:57:36.860
That was Rav Sa'ad Yadav.

00:57:36.860 --> 00:57:43.620
And he counted the letters, and there are 613.

00:57:43.620 --> 00:57:50.240
613 of the letters are according to the commandments.

00:57:50.240 --> 00:57:52.480
We have 613 commandments.

00:57:52.480 --> 00:57:54.800
The thesis of Seadi Agaon is obviously

00:57:54.800 --> 00:57:56.580
that each one of the 10 commandments

00:57:56.580 --> 00:58:03.460
represents a class of commandments.

00:58:03.460 --> 00:58:09.560
And then we have seven other extra words, letters rather, because it's 620,

00:58:09.560 --> 00:58:18.040
and these are the Sheba Misloot and the Noah, the seven commandments that pertain to the non-Jewish people

00:58:18.040 --> 00:58:21.340
who wish to live in Israel, in the land of Israel.

00:58:22.160 --> 00:58:32.200
Now, we're going to see, by the way, can you imagine what society was before the Ten Commandments?

00:58:32.200 --> 00:58:34.500
if there's any civilization

00:58:34.500 --> 00:58:35.400
any place

00:58:35.400 --> 00:58:38.140
it's because we the Jewish people

00:58:38.140 --> 00:58:42.500
we brought

00:58:42.500 --> 00:58:43.920
the whole Ten Commandments

00:58:43.920 --> 00:58:46.820
you know what's wrong with America?

00:58:48.040 --> 00:58:49.100
the Ten Commandments

00:58:49.100 --> 00:58:49.720
are not fulfilled

00:58:49.720 --> 00:58:52.460
you know what?

00:58:52.720 --> 00:58:54.000
you want to fix the world?

00:58:54.820 --> 00:58:55.560
Ten Commandments

00:58:55.560 --> 00:58:58.500
simple as that

00:58:58.500 --> 00:59:06.780
First misva.

00:59:07.820 --> 00:59:13.620
I am Adonai.

00:59:15.080 --> 00:59:21.220
Adonai means the supreme omnipotent who is above all the laws,

00:59:21.220 --> 00:59:26.720
who is above physics, who is above human rationality,

00:59:26.720 --> 00:59:29.060
who created everything from nothing,

00:59:30.120 --> 00:59:32.560
the great master, the absolute master,

00:59:33.360 --> 00:59:34.240
Anokhi Adonai.

00:59:35.420 --> 00:59:38.580
And at the same time that I am Adonai,

00:59:39.780 --> 00:59:41.240
I am Elohecha.

00:59:42.240 --> 00:59:43.900
Second person singular,

00:59:44.220 --> 00:59:45.920
I am your God.

00:59:46.380 --> 00:59:48.520
I know what you're feeling.

00:59:49.240 --> 00:59:50.980
I know what you care.

00:59:50.980 --> 00:59:53.000
I know what you want.

00:59:53.680 --> 00:59:55.680
I know what you need.

00:59:56.720 --> 01:00:15.400
And you could speak to me directly and I will communicate with you directly. Ano hi Adonai? Eloheza. And how do you know that I am Adonai and at the same time I am Eloheza?

01:00:15.400 --> 01:00:33.860
I took you out from Egypt. Egypt, the last haka, was an inferno of microbes, bacterias, all the people dying around, the Becholot and so on.

01:00:33.860 --> 01:00:39.000
And yet, Hosea, I took you out from Egypt.

01:00:39.860 --> 01:00:42.980
Means I care about individual people.

01:00:43.920 --> 01:00:54.200
Doesn't mean because I am the God of the universe that I don't care about Abraham, Moshe, what's his name, Raphule, Salome, whatever it is.

01:00:54.460 --> 01:00:57.480
I care about every single Jew.

01:00:57.960 --> 01:00:59.940
Anohi Adonai Elohecha.

01:00:59.940 --> 01:01:01.580
And the proof is,

01:01:02.380 --> 01:01:07.480
And this is another very important point.

01:01:07.560 --> 01:01:08.460
Ribbi Ulannevi says,

01:01:09.400 --> 01:01:14.620
That I created heavens and earth.

01:01:14.660 --> 01:01:15.080
You know why?

01:01:16.420 --> 01:01:18.100
No, that God created heavens and earth.

01:01:18.240 --> 01:01:19.540
That's a theory.

01:01:21.080 --> 01:01:24.740
Yes, the atmosphere was something that every single Jew experienced.

01:01:25.420 --> 01:01:28.780
Based upon your own personal experience.

01:01:29.940 --> 01:01:35.940
You know that there is a light Eloheka.

01:01:35.940 --> 01:01:44.940
And by the way, this is true 3500 years ago, 3800 years ago, it is true today.

01:01:44.940 --> 01:01:47.940
Look into your own individual life.

01:01:47.940 --> 01:01:56.940
Look when you were in Nusra'il, because all of us at one time was in a moment of agony, of crisis.

01:01:56.940 --> 01:01:59.700
and you thought that everything was lost,

01:02:00.800 --> 01:02:02.860
and yet Boli Olam comes and saves you,

01:02:03.820 --> 01:02:04.760
what does it mean?

01:02:05.100 --> 01:02:06.700
That he knows what you want,

01:02:07.120 --> 01:02:08.280
he knows what you need.

01:02:09.120 --> 01:02:10.480
أَشَرْحُ سَتِكَ وَهِي

01:02:10.480 --> 01:02:13.180
From the house of slaves.

01:02:14.240 --> 01:02:15.060
Ribbi Moshe Haver says,

01:02:15.180 --> 01:02:18.180
not of slavery or slavitude,

01:02:18.920 --> 01:02:20.060
you know, slaves.

01:02:20.300 --> 01:02:21.820
Everybody was a slave there.

01:02:22.780 --> 01:02:23.380
Slaves.

01:02:23.800 --> 01:02:24.420
Let me speak.

01:02:24.840 --> 01:02:26.360
Everybody is a slave.

01:02:26.940 --> 01:02:28.100
Everybody is bad.

01:02:28.480 --> 01:02:29.700
Everybody is rotten.

01:02:30.760 --> 01:02:33.840
And I was able to distinguish between one and the other.

01:02:33.840 --> 01:02:34.980
Hashem said,

01:02:35.160 --> 01:02:43.400
Therefore, since God knows you,

01:02:44.660 --> 01:02:46.380
and you have access to God,

01:02:47.860 --> 01:02:54.020
there is no need for intercessors.

01:02:54.020 --> 01:02:56.600
there is no need for

01:02:56.600 --> 01:02:58.780
statues

01:02:58.780 --> 01:02:59.840
idols

01:02:59.840 --> 01:03:03.160
to serve as a mediator between you and God

01:03:03.160 --> 01:03:05.360
you know who needs mediators?

01:03:06.180 --> 01:03:08.340
in a hierarchical society

01:03:08.340 --> 01:03:11.080
you're too small to find somebody to be free

01:03:11.080 --> 01:03:13.220
but in the case of God

01:03:13.220 --> 01:03:17.580
I took and selected every Jew myself

01:03:17.580 --> 01:03:20.360
I do care about the individual

01:03:20.360 --> 01:03:21.760
therefore

01:03:21.760 --> 01:03:23.440
of the way of the time in the New Testament.

01:03:24.300 --> 01:03:26.880
It is no need to have any angel

01:03:26.880 --> 01:03:29.540
or any saint or any idol

01:03:29.540 --> 01:03:32.180
or any spar or any constellation

01:03:32.180 --> 01:03:36.100
to be an intercessor between you and me.

01:03:36.420 --> 01:03:39.240
Because we could have a direct relationship.

01:03:39.580 --> 01:03:42.000
You see the relationship between the first verse and the second?

01:03:42.800 --> 01:03:43.280
Now,

01:03:45.760 --> 01:03:47.820
I intend accordingly,

01:03:48.440 --> 01:03:48.740
therefore,

01:03:48.920 --> 01:03:51.040
don't make yourself an idol,

01:03:51.040 --> 01:03:56.600
or something supposed to be in heaven

01:03:56.600 --> 01:03:57.660
like an angel

01:03:57.660 --> 01:04:01.240
something which is in the earth

01:04:01.240 --> 01:04:03.200
or the water

01:04:03.200 --> 01:04:06.340
you should not bow to them

01:04:06.340 --> 01:04:08.640
all of it is part of the second misva

01:04:08.640 --> 01:04:08.940
yes?

01:04:09.740 --> 01:04:10.400
on the second day

01:04:10.400 --> 01:04:13.680
don't worship them

01:04:13.680 --> 01:04:17.220
I am your God

01:04:17.220 --> 01:04:19.980
I am jealous

01:04:19.980 --> 01:04:23.040
People say, oh, welcome to God, this guy.

01:04:23.040 --> 01:04:23.700
God is jealous.

01:04:23.700 --> 01:04:26.740
It's like this.

01:04:26.740 --> 01:04:33.360
Imagine today you receive a telephone call from Clinton.

01:04:33.360 --> 01:04:34.740
Why?

01:04:34.740 --> 01:04:37.080
I invited you to come for dinner with me,

01:04:37.080 --> 01:04:40.560
and I found out that you went with your friend instead

01:04:40.560 --> 01:04:42.240
of coming to dinner with me.

01:04:42.240 --> 01:04:46.540
Won't you feel proud because you say, Clinton, yes,

01:04:46.540 --> 01:04:49.920
he invited me, and now when I didn't accept the invitation,

01:04:49.920 --> 01:04:53.260
He got angry about it.

01:04:53.560 --> 01:04:56.900
In the same way, God, He who loves, is jealous.

01:04:57.500 --> 01:05:00.500
Jealousy here is an expression of loving you.

01:05:00.500 --> 01:05:06.120
And because He loves you, He cannot understand how come you're going to go to a piece of stone,

01:05:06.720 --> 01:05:10.320
to pray to a piece of stone, instead of praying directly to Him.

01:05:10.740 --> 01:05:11.060
You understand?

01:05:11.480 --> 01:05:15.380
It's just like, I don't know, you're a good husband, and then a wife goes to another guy.

01:05:15.840 --> 01:05:16.560
I'm jealous.

01:05:17.920 --> 01:05:18.400
Angry.

01:05:19.920 --> 01:05:22.100
because you love, it's out of love.

01:05:22.600 --> 01:05:24.900
It's not out of anger, it's out of love.

01:05:25.480 --> 01:05:25.720
Alright?

01:05:28.260 --> 01:05:29.560
And it says something like this,

01:05:30.220 --> 01:05:31.880
وَكِنْ عَبُدْ عَبُدْ عَلْبَنِيمٍ

01:05:31.880 --> 01:05:34.740
Now, very important,

01:05:34.920 --> 01:05:39.000
this pasuq is mistranslated by everybody.

01:05:39.800 --> 01:05:40.960
Except Ribbi Moshe Hefes,

01:05:41.040 --> 01:05:43.520
the first one who pointed out what the real translation is.

01:05:44.560 --> 01:05:45.900
وَكِنْ عَبُدْ عَبُدْ عَبْنِيمٍ

01:05:45.900 --> 01:05:48.520
When you make a abon yourself,

01:05:48.520 --> 01:05:58.520
I'm not going to punish you only for what you did to your son, but you also set a bad example to your children and your grandchildren.

01:05:58.520 --> 01:06:11.520
For I want to punish you not only for what you did to yourself, but you're going to be smoking coke at home.

01:06:11.520 --> 01:06:20.520
Example. You're not only harming your health, you're setting an example for your children.

01:06:20.520 --> 01:06:26.520
When you are worshipping idols, you're setting an example for your children and your grandchildren.

01:06:26.520 --> 01:06:31.520
When you're eating tareh, you're setting an example for your children and your grandchildren.

01:06:31.520 --> 01:06:32.520
So therefore,

01:06:32.520 --> 01:06:33.600
I want a what?

01:06:34.360 --> 01:06:34.940
Al-Banim.

01:06:35.900 --> 01:06:37.720
Because what they did to the children,

01:06:38.080 --> 01:06:38.760
they are Al-Banim,

01:06:39.160 --> 01:06:39.820
Ash-Lashim,

01:06:39.900 --> 01:06:40.440
they are Al-Baim.

01:06:40.740 --> 01:06:41.260
Grandchildren,

01:06:41.400 --> 01:06:42.020
great-grandchildren.

01:06:42.840 --> 01:06:43.020
Alright?

01:06:45.380 --> 01:06:45.900
Lesonei.

01:06:47.280 --> 01:06:49.180
Lesonei is one of those words

01:06:49.180 --> 01:06:51.320
that has been mispronounced by everybody.

01:06:51.760 --> 01:06:52.240
What does it mean,

01:06:52.300 --> 01:06:52.840
Lesonei?

01:06:55.200 --> 01:06:55.760
Exactly.

01:06:56.820 --> 01:06:59.140
Not those who...

01:06:59.140 --> 01:06:59.460
No!

01:07:00.340 --> 01:07:00.700
No!

01:07:00.700 --> 01:07:02.600
No.

01:07:02.600 --> 01:07:05.700
doesn't mean those that I hate.

01:07:05.700 --> 01:07:07.200
Those who hate me.

01:07:07.200 --> 01:07:08.360
.

